ult theme (1):** the confidence intervals leaderboards publish versus worst-case fragility. The run did not compute those intervals itself, so this query only supports the contrast.\n\n**What I kept out:**\n- Queries that restate the research question, such as \"stability of pairwise comparison leaderboards\", along with any \"who cites Huang et al.\" searches. These could surface the paper we are not allowed to read, and the queries above cover the same ground without that risk.\n- Generic benchmarking or optimization filler.\n- Queries naming the untested methods or describing the run's history.\n\nThese exclusions are listed in `forbidden_query_patterns`. The planning decisions are also appended to `./memory.md`, `global_memory/memory.md` and `global_memory/memory.jsonl`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2559,"cache_read_input_tokens":44269,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2559},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99ef2d0e-c81b-4a3c-ae36-c2fd72b6b289","uuid":"7f0ba758-dd7a-4d12-a0ef-94bc5a77d28f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T23:45:39.326Z","request_id":"req_011CgVXRd33uc9J62sQsbgzd"}
